#. module: om_tally_stock
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_tally_stock
msgid ""
"Brings the inventory masters of a Tally company into Odoo: units, product "
"categories, products matched by part number, name or HSN, godowns as "
"locations, batches as lots, and the opening stock per godown and batch, "
"valued at the rate of Tally. Invoices made from Tally vouchers get their "
"products."
msgstr ""

